    "body": "The title and body now state the real mechanism: the guide-height and `edm.max_taper_deg` checks in `crates/app/src/machine/wire_edm.rs`, and the vertical-only refusal in `assets/posts/sodick-wire.cps`. The code named in the first body does not exist; see comment 6889993998. The gap stands: no shipped path applies a taper. Source: review of PR #1793, head ef93ed0bf, comment 6890311801.\n",
